===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Mr. Mime|30}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*'''Barrier Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Porygon|98}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
